      "title": "Letterboxd review of Inside Man",
      "snippet": "[Letterboxd Review of \"Inside Man\"] A fun, sturdy little heist programmer with the most overqualified cast and crew you've ever seen. Spike could not be having more fun getting to do his own clever, tightly-plotted little magic trick riff on Dog Day Afternoon peppered with his brand of NY personality humor, throwaway details on race/class (that other filmmakers would likely ignore tbh) and a massive Terrance Blanchard score. Denzel in that fit, delivering the line \"thank you... bank robber\", just the goat. A total blast.",
