      "title": "Heist School Confidential movie review - Roger Ebert",
      "snippet": "\"Inside Man\" goes to much difficulty to arrive at too little. It starts with the taut action of a superior caper movie, but then it meanders; eventually the narration slows to the pace of a Garrison Keillor story on \" A Prairie Home Companion,\" which is nice if you are a prairie, but if not, not.",
